---
layout: base
title: Oliver - 锂电工艺工程师
description: 锂离子电池制造工艺工程笔记。涂布、辊压、化成、良率优化 — 从材料科学到量产工艺的实践记录。
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="name">{{ home.name }}</h1>
  <p class="title">{{ home.title }}</p>
  <p class="tagline">{{ home.tagline }}</p>
</section>

<section class="handbook-feature">
  <a href="/handbook/" class="handbook-card">
    <div class="handbook-icon">📖</div>
    <div class="handbook-info">
      <h2 class="handbook-title">工程学能用手册</h2>
      <p class="handbook-description">给现场用的工程扳手</p>
    </div>
    <div class="handbook-arrow">→</div>
  </a>
  <div class="daily-check">
    <span class="check-label">今日能检查</span>
    <p class="check-content">这东西最可能的一种坏法是什么？坏了以后能量、压力、毒性、信息，往哪泄？</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% if home.show_latest_posts %}
<section class="notes-section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>最新笔记</h2>
    <a href="/notes/" class="view-all">查看全部</a>
  </div>
  
  {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
  {% if loop.index <= home.latest_posts_count %}
  <article class="note-card">
    <time class="note-date" datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
    <h3 class="note-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
    <p class="note-excerpt">{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
  </article>
  {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endif %}
